## Chapter 7 — The Brand–Product Bridge (NEW — ZUKA's most distinctive asset)

ZUKA's brand is not expressed mainly through a logo. It is expressed through the
**living information system** — and this connection was never written down. This
is the chapter that makes the brand uniquely ZUKA's.

```
The brand IS the live system. Every live signal is a brand moment:

CITY PULSE STRIP    "47 events live in Kampala" + rising bars = the essence
                    ("the city, alive") stated literally, every app open.
GO LIVE             The pulse of the waveform Z made real: a venue makes the
                    city come alive, and the brand's core promise fires.
CROWD METER         Quiet → Picking Up → Packed: energy as information, in the
                    information-colour ramp (neutral → gold → coral).
HEAT MAP            The city literally glowing where it's alive. Coral pulses
                    on a Midnight map = the brand in one image.
LIVE WALL           Real human moments (Vibe Drops) = "warm, local, real" —
                    the personality made visible, never stock imagery.

DESIGN CONSEQUENCE: stock photography and generic "event app" illustration are
OFF-BRAND. ZUKA's imagery is real Kampala, real venues, real crowds, real
moments — or it is the abstract glow of the live system itself. Never a smiling
model holding a phone.
```

