## Chapter 10 — Founder Rules

```
1. The brand is the live system, not the logo.
2. Colour carries meaning — never decorate with an information colour.
3. Speak present-tense, local, warm, honest. Show energy; never manufacture it.
4. Real Kampala over stock imagery, always.
5. Lock the strategy; let the system mature. Keep expansion-brand dormant.
The brand succeeds when a person feels the city come alive before they read a
single word.
```

